From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: karol <karolprzybylak1@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:21:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] sx1302: add Bobcat Miner 300 (G285) model

The Bobcat Miner 300 G285 is a Rockchip RK3566 board with an SX1302 +
2x SX1250 mini-PCIe card on SPI1. The SX1302 reset is on GPIO4_C5 and the
socket power on GPIO3_D2; the card has no STTS751 temperature sensor.

RF parameters are the factory firmware's EU868 values, read from a G285:
the TX gain table differs from Semtech's SX1302C868GW1 reference.

Upstream-Status: Pending [to be offered upstream once tested on a board]
---
 .../src/config/mod.rs                         |   1 +
 .../src/config/vendor/bobcat/miner300_g285.rs | 195 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../src/config/vendor/bobcat/mod.rs           |   1 +
 .../src/config/vendor/mod.rs                  |   1 +
 4 files changed, 198 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 chirpstack-concentratord-sx1302/src/config/vendor/bobcat/miner300_g285.rs
